SUMMARY:Ideateam Live at The HIVE
DESCRIPTION:Live at The HIVE presents Ideateam during an outdoor concert. Doors at 5:30pm; Music at 6:30pm. \nIdeateam is a Sacramento-based musical team who collectively collaborate to refine their craft through their distinct original compositions\, along with an array of both vintage and modern cover arrangements. The band’s live sets flow in and around a winding fusion of grooves while leaning on a foundation of experimental funk\, soul\, and R&B sounds. \nEnjoy a seasonal menu\, craft beverages and complimentary honey tasting at northern California’s largest honey and mead tasting room. \nPay what you can cover charge: $0-$20/person. Family and dog friendly. All ages welcome. No outside food or drinks.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/ideateam-live-at-the-hive/
LOCATION:The HIVE / Z Specialty Food\, The HIVE Tasting Room and Kitchen
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Ideateam-small.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The HIVE / Z Specialty Food":MAILTO:events@zspecialtyfood.com
END:VEVENT
