SUMMARY:BGV Presents A Culinary Journey Through Italy with Georgeanne Brennan - Taste of Sicily Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss the final dinner of Berryessa Gap Vineyards Culinary Journey Through Tuscany series! \nJoin us on October 17 for our Taste of Sicily Dinner\, an unforgettable evening celebrating the flavors and traditions of Sicily. Curated by award-winning author Georgeanne Brennan\, this special dinner will feature a menu inspired by traditional Sicilian cuisine. \nTickets for General Public – $140 \nTickets for Wine Club Members – $120
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/bgv-presents-a-culinary-journey-through-italy-with-georgeanne-brennan-taste-of-sicily-dinner/
LOCATION:22 Main St. Winters\,CA\, 22 Main Street\, WINTERS\, CA\, 95694-0728\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Wine-glasses_web.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Berryessa Gap Vineyards":MAILTO:events@berryessagap.com
END:VEVENT
