SUMMARY:Dia De Muertos
DESCRIPTION:CommuniCare+OLE hosts an annual\, free community Dia de Muertos celebration in Woodland\, California\, aimed at honoring Mexican heritage and reducing mental health stigma. The family-friendly event features interactive altars\, live performances\, workshops\, and local health resources for hundreds of attendees.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/dia-de-muertos/
